  "description": "The Deal Advisor Workflow proactively identifies and analyzes sales opportunities by leveraging advanced AI to synthesize vast amounts of market, customer, and internal data. It delivers actionable insights to sales teams, enhancing conversion rates and accelerating revenue growth.",
  "specification": {
    "dataPipeline": {
